---
description: Cascade dev flow for a lead agent that launches Cursor cloud agents
alwaysApply: false
---

When you delegate coding work to cloud agents:

- Write a brief using templates/brief.md before launching.
- Start at the cheapest tier that fits (see docs/routing.md): composer-2.5, then grok-4.7, then Anthropic models only if needed.
- At most 2 attempts per tier; escalate on the same PR with the real error.
- Send a PR to review only when CI is green.
- Review level follows risk: trivial none, normal 1 round, security-sensitive 2 rounds with a different model family.
- Never merge, tag or release without explicit human approval.
